OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe is one of multiple women in the
OL,8,Freport who claim Walliams used his
OL,9,Fcelebrity status to prey on them for
OL,10,Fsexual purposes when they were
OL,11,Fteenagers or young women
OL,13,FHe has denied all allegations, saying:
OL,14,F"I am not a sexual predator." But he
OL,15,Facknowledges "at times I behaved
OL,16,Fthoughtlessly towards other people"
OL,18,FWalliams had asked the High Court to
OL,19,Fblock the publication of the
OL,20,Finvestigation, and said if the
OL,21,Fallegations were made public it was
OL,22,F"highly likely" he would kill himself
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
