OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe court refused the request, saying
OL,8,Fthe risks could be mitigated and that
OL,9,Fit was not the court's responsibility
OL,10,Fto protect his wellbeing
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
