OL,3,AUS military aircraft leave second UK
OL,4,Abase
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 10 US Air Force refuelling
OL,7,Faircraft left a second airbase in
OL,8,FBritain on Monday.
OL,10,FFlight tracking data seen by BBC Verify
OL,11,Fshows the aircraft left RAF Mildenhall
OL,12,Fin Suffolk and landed at other American
OL,13,Fbases in Europe and also at Prestwick
OL,14,FAirport in Ayrshire.
OL,16,FThe Wall Street Journal reported that
OL,17,Fthis was in response to a threat from
OL,18,FIran but the BBC has not independently
OL,19,Fverified that claim.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
