OL,3,AUS military aircraft leave second UK
OL,4,Abase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonday's departures come weeks after
OL,7,Fthe US withdrew its bombers from RAF
OL,8,FFairford airbase over a suspected
OL,9,FIran-linked security incident.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
