OL,3,AMet Police investigating more
OL,4,A'potential criminal allegations' about
OL,5,ABrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police have said
OL,8,Fseveral people contacted them during
OL,9,Fthe trial and following the conviction
OL,10,Fand sentencing of the disgraced
OL,11,Fcomedian Russell Brand, "to provide
OL,12,Finformation or report a potential
OL,13,Fcriminal allegation".
OL,15,FA Met spokesperson said: "Detectives
OL,16,Fare assessing this information as part
OL,17,Fof their ongoing enquiries."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
