OL,3,ADR Congo sentences 66 soldiers to death
OL,4,Afor being 'cowards'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 66 soldiers have been
OL,7,Fsentenced to death in the Democratic
OL,8,FRepublic of Congo for cowardice, mutiny
OL,9,Fand refusing to obey orders, local
OL,10,Fmedia report.
OL,12,FThe sentences followed a trial of 71
OL,13,Fsoldiers before a military court in
OL,14,FWalikale, in North Kivu province, in
OL,15,Feastern DR Congo. Four soldiers were
OL,16,Facquitted, while another was sentenced
OL,17,Fto 10 years in prison.
OL,19,FThe army said the trial was intended to
OL,20,Fimprove discipline among troops as they
OL,21,Fbattle armed groups in eastern DR
OL,22,FCongo.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
